          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye ŵamtumile soni jwamkulungwa jwine jwa ngondo pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵane 50. Jwamkulungwa jwa ngondojo pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwewo ŵajawile kuja kumsalila Eliya kuti, “Ŵalakwe mundu jwa Mlungu, mwenye akwalamula kuti atuluce mwacitemacitema.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Eliya ŵamjanjile kuti, “Naga uneji kweli ndili mundu jwa Mlungu, moto utuluce kwinani, umtinisye m'mwejo pamo ni ŵandu ŵenu 50 ŵimli nawoŵa.” Ndaŵi jijojo, moto ŵa Mlungu ŵatulwice kwinani, ni ŵamtinisye jwamkulungwa jwa ngondo jula pamo ni ŵandu ŵakwe 50 ŵala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jula, ŵamtumisye soni jwamkulungwa jwa ngondo jwine jwatatu, pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe 50. Nambo jwamkulungwa jwatatu jula ŵajawile kuja kutindiŵala pameso pa Eliya, ni ŵamdandawulile kuti, “Ŵalakwe mundu jwa Mlungu, conde andendele canasa, akambulaga uneji pamo ni ŵandu ŵangu 50. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moto watulwice kwinani nipo watinisye acimjangu ŵaŵili ŵala pamo ni ŵandu ŵaŵaliji nawo. Conde andendele canasa yikambonecela yele yinduyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
