          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilayika lya AMBUJE lyamsalile Eliya kuti, “Mlongane najo, mkajogopa.” Myoyo Eliya ŵatulwice mwitumbi pamo ni jwamkulungwa jwa ngondojo, kwawula kwa mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya ŵamsalile mwenyejo kuti, “Ambuje akusala kuti, ‘Ligongo lyakuti mwatumisye ŵandu ŵamitenga kuja kuŵenda lunda kwa Baala Sebubi, mlungu jwa ŵandu ŵa ku Ekiloni, mpela kwangali Mlungu jwa mpaka kumŵenda lunda ku Isalaeli kuno, ngamjimuka pa cindanda cimgonileco, nambo tim'we.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Ahasiya ŵawile muŵaŵacetele AMBUJE kupitila mwa jwakulocesya Eliya. Ni pakuŵapo Ahasiya nginakola mwanace jwamlume, Yolamu mlongo mjakwe ni juŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe, mcaka caŵili ca ucimwene wa Yeholamu, mwanace jwa Yehoshafati, mwenye jwa ku Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
